# Native witnesses for the eight automizer

These packed rows propose evaluations of three words in a conjugate of the
actual F-normalizer and their actions on the native eight. The separate Checks
modules verify every multiplication in the kernel. The reproducible discovery
and generation script is retained in Scratch/J4EightPlacement/generate_native.py.
Source: Kleidman--Wilson (1988), Corollary 2.3.6.
-/
